    - Compute object size from bars+cells; ensure object fits with >=2 margin on each side
    - Place the lattice on a bg grid at a random position respecting margins
    - Verify the lattice forms one 4-connected component
    - Output is produced by applying the wave shift; no generation needed
  constraints:
