    3. Build tile via tile[r][c] = ((r - offset[c]) % rp) + 1; wallpaper it over 22x25 grid = output
    4. Verify bg=1 is unique most-frequent color in output (guaranteed by construction)
    5. Choose 3-6 random rectangular regions (2-5 rows x 2-5 cols) scattered across the grid
